<section class="svcs reveal" style="padding-top:44px">
  <div class="wrap" style="max-width:780px">
    <div class="polsec"><h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p class="editable">When you use the contact form, we receive the name, email, phone number, and message you choose to share. We use it only to reply to you. Form submissions are delivered to us through Netlify Forms, our website host, which processes the submission on our behalf.</p></div>
    <div class="polsec"><h2>Booking</h2>
      <p class="editable">Appointments are booked through Square. Any information you enter there (including payment details and intake answers) is handled by Square under <a href="https://squareup.com/us/en/legal/general/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--rose-deep);border-bottom:1px solid var(--rose)">Square's privacy policy</a>. We never see or store your card numbers.</p></div>
    <div class="polsec"><h2>Cookies &amp; analytics</h2>
      <p class="editable">This website does not set cookies and does not run advertising or analytics trackers. The contact page includes an embedded Google Map, which is loaded from Google and is subject to Google's privacy policy.</p></div>
    <div class="polsec"><h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p class="editable">Want us to delete a message you sent us, or update your details? Just ask. Email <a href="mailto:{{ site.contact.email }}" style="color:var(--rose-deep)">{{ site.contact.email }}</a> or text <a href="tel:{{ site.contact.phone_e164 }}" style="color:var(--rose-deep)">{{ site.contact.phone_display }}</a> and we'll take care of it.</p></div>
    <p style="font-size:13.5px;color:var(--fg-soft)">Effective July 2, 2026 &middot; {{ site.business.name }}, {{ site.address.street }}, {{ site.address.city }}, {{ site.address.region }} {{ site.address.postal_code }}</p>
  </div>
